    "created_at": "2020-02-25T09:12:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-02-25T09:12:42Z",
    "body": "To be clear, even if this were added the backend would still have to account for double submissions as network conditions might also yield multiple POSTs. Adding this might in fact lead to less robustness as it's no longer as frequently observed.",
