    "body": "Adding to the log here that [yesterday this issue sparked up again with some devs](https://twitter.com/sebdedeyne/status/1323921783729377280). I've collected the thoughts expressed both here and on Twitter in a blogpost over at https://www.bram.us/2020/11/04/preventing-double-form-submissions/",
