    "updated_at": "2025-04-25T08:03:01Z",
    "body": "Maybe: fail validation if the form has already been submitted with the same form data. Maybe the submit button, or currently focused control for implicit submit without a default button, can be the element that is invalid?\n\nPros:\n- allows showing a message to the user\n- bypass mechanisms exist already (e.g. `novalidate`, `submit()`)\n\nCons:\n- doesn't help with existing content using bypass mechanisms (e.g. `novalidate`, `submit()`)\n\nThe user attempting to submit a third time, or changing any value in the form, could clear the validity state.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
