    "updated_at": "2025-10-31T13:04:51Z",
    "body": "I learned that holding the `Enter` key on a `button` element will rapidly repeat the `keypress` event and so can submit a form many times. ([Demo](https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/14278).) So \"attempting to submit a third time\" is maybe not good enough. But an implementation-defined timeout (e.g. 5 seconds) should solve this.",
