    "body": "Related: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11743 deals with this for duplicated navigations in general (with a time difference threshold of 3s) but is limited to `GET` requests only.\n\nPerhaps this is also a way out for this here, where the browser prevents the second submission of the form (with the same data) when it happens within x seconds? The time between the two clicks of a double click can be pretty short, so a value of 1s could probably already prevent a lot of erroneous double submissions caused by a double click.",
